 "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py flood-fills each group on a pasted board and prints its stones and liberty count with a danger flag, and count.py flood-fills empty regions to tally territory plus komi on a given position; both only inspect the current position, and nothing scores candidate moves or plays out continuations.", "stop": false}}